                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-right">
                <h2>Where excitement meets unforgettable moments</h2>
                <p>
                    Experience the best cultural events in your city with metropolitan cultural council's official ticketing platform, <span style="color: #0b1b3a; font-weight: bold;">CulturaPass</span>. From concerts to exhibitions, 
                    workshops to performances - we bring together the best entertainment right to your fingertips. 
                    Join thousands of event-goers who trust us for their memorable experiences.
                </p>
                <a href="@Url.Action("About", "Home")" class="btn-dark">Learn More</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats Section -->
<section class="about-stats">
